# Keep line endings stable across platforms: the repo stores LF and checks out
# LF everywhere. Without this a Windows clone rewrites every file it touches and
# the diff noise buries real changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# These scripts carry a UTF-8 BOM (Windows PowerShell 5.1 decodes a BOM-less
# script as ANSI and mangles non-ASCII text), so Git must never rewrite their
# bytes or line endings.
*.ps1 -text
